      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I used Opus but I tried a video file stripped of audio and it does the same thing, VP8 is expected to work I believe as per https://docs.unity3d.com/2021.3/Documentation/Manual/VideoSources-FileCompatibility.html#CompatibilityWithTargetPlatforms but Unity just... forgot about the rest",
