      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5bb3e7b0da8b6d259d417a09|full_name} video playback ends up being an interesting mix of technology. \n\nI figured out why vp8 was giving me trouble. turns out that vp8 webm with unity video requires https. mp4's work fine\n\nthe internet at large is all https these days, but an insecure webserver is easy to spin up on localhost\n\nnow i can uninstall either vp9 or av1 and see what happens.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
